<lb n="1"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Himmanuel</persName>.
<lb n="2"/>Reverendi, Clarissimi, Doctissimique Viri, Fautores, Patres et Fratres
<lb n="3"/>in Christo Domino plurimum nobis dilecti atque honorandi, Etsi nobis
<lb n="4"/><placeName resp="#ner">Palatinatus superioris</placeName> Exulibus, qui ab inferiori dierum aliquot
<lb n="5"/>itinere semoti sumus, assidue cum grata recordatione in mente
<lb n="6"/>versetur, quae et quanta Ecclesia Vestra ad petitionem nostram
<lb n="7"/>superioribus annis <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Amplissimi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Magistratus</unclear> vestri concessu, nec non
<lb n="8"/>vestra adhortatione, in nos contulerit: eaque subventione nos
<lb n="9"/>merito contenti esse, nec patientiam vestram et Vestratium
<lb n="10"/>ulterius tentare, aut in nova ope exposcenda, negotium <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vo</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bis</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">facessere</unclear> deberemus: Tamen quid non mortalia pectora
<lb n="12"/>cogit dura Necessitas? Et quid non sperare nos jubet Vestra
<lb n="13"/>in afflictos Exules <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">συμπάθεια</unclear> et ἔνδειξις Caritatis Vestrae
<lb n="14"/>in domesticos fidei: quam non semel nos ipsi antehac tam illu-
<lb n="15"/>stribus argumentis cognovimus atque experti sumus. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Illa</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">igi</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tur</unclear> compulsi, hac freti, vos <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hisce</unclear> literis <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nostris</unclear> compellan-
<lb n="17"/>di fiduciam cepimus: quibus itidem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inclusimus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Apographum</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">earum</unclear>, quas ad Ampl. Senatum Vestrum adornavimus, quas
<lb n="19"/>prius perlectas et ponderatas si judicio Vestró approbaveritis,
<lb n="20"/>ut cum favorabili commendationis Vestrae suffragio nomine
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nostro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haud</unclear> gravatim exhibeatis, reverenter et diligenter
<lb n="22"/>a vobis petimus. Neque id solum, sed etiam, si <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Magistratus</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>Vester petitioni nostrae clementer annuerit, ut deinde causam
<lb n="24"/>etiam nostram apud auditores Vestros publice agatis: proque
<lb n="25"/>ea qua polletis, dicendi facultate et gratia, eorum benevo-
<lb n="26"/>lentiam nobis conciliare studeatis. Adjunximus praeterea
<lb n="27"/>catalogum coexulum nostrorum, qui hoc sacrae Collectae beneficio
<lb n="28"/>inpraesens ordinarie fruuntur, cum brevi declaratione affli-
<lb n="29"/>ctissimi status eorundem ut et paucitate et necessitate illorum
<lb n="30"/>perspecta, tanto facilius procliviusque impetrari atque conferri
<lb n="31"/>aliquid possit: quod quantulumcunque etiam fuerit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">magno</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">certe</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>solatio atque allevamento nobis erit. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Quod</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> propter onera
<lb n="33"/>et difficultates, quibus aut Resp. vestra aut vos ipsi hoc tem-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3672_14710.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>pore forsan laborabitis, aut propter alias causas, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nihil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">impetremus</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bonus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tamen</unclear> vultus, bona oratio, bonus animus et responsum bonum
<lb n="36"/>solatio nobis et muneris instar erit. Oramus autem aeternum
<lb n="37"/>patrem domini nostri Jesu Christi, ut ipse <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">decurtet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dies</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">affli</unclear>-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ctionum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nostrarum</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nec</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">quiescere</unclear> diutius faciat virgam iniqui-
<lb n="39"/>tatis super sortem justorum: ut non extendant justi adullam
<lb n="40"/>iniquitatem manus suas. Vestram autem ecclesiam et remp. ut
<lb n="41"/>a simili nostra calamitate <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clementer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">praeservet</unclear>: ac in veri-
<lb n="42"/>tate et pace custodiat tanq pupillam oculi sui; sit vobis murus
<lb n="43"/>igneus circumquaq. Valete viri praestantissimi, dni. fau-
<lb n="44"/>tores patres et fratres nobis ex animo venerandi ac <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">revivesci</unclear>-
<lb n="45"/>te in vestra pro nobis cura. Jehova erit clypeus vester, mer-
<lb n="46"/>ces vestra ampla valde. Et nos, quicquid <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nostri</unclear> causa denuo
<lb n="47"/>feceritis, gratis animis atq linguis agnoscemus ac <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">praedicabi</unclear>-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mus</unclear>. Perscript. <origPlace resp="#ner">Norimb.</origPlace> <origDate resp="#ner">a. d. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">23</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">10br</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">M</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">DC</unclear>. XLV.</origDate>
